    "tactics": "These sprites are most effective near water or in wet environments. On dry ground they are merely annoying; in a flooded room or near a river they are genuinely threatening, using Slick Passage to create hazardous terrain and their reach to attack without closing.",
    "attacksNotes": "<p>Water Lash [Combat]: Melee attack (Agil 5 + Melee Combat 1), Reach: 10 ft</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Margin 1:</strong>: 4 damage (2 + 2 Str) + 2 cold damage</li>\n<li><strong>Margin 2:</strong> 4 damage, DR halved (round up) + 2 cold damage</li>\n</ul>",
    "specialAbilitiesNotes": "<p>Aqueous Form: Can enter and exit water as a [Free] action. While in water, ### Attacks against it add 1 to both dice. Slick Passage: When the Riptide Sprite moves through a space, that space becomes Difficult Terrain until the start of the Sprite's next turn (water coating the ground).</p>",
